            <tr><td>Frequency</td><td>Daily, especially after desk work</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table></div>

        <h3>3. Reverse Prayer Stretch</h3>
        <p>Press the backs of your hands together in front of your chest with fingers pointing down. Slowly raise your hands toward chin level. This stretches the wrist extensors on the back of the forearm. Hold for 20-30 seconds.</p>
