        <h3>4. Tabletop Wrist Rocks</h3>
        <p>Place your palms flat on a table or the floor with fingers pointing forward. Rock your bodyweight forward over your hands, then backward. This mobilizes the wrist through flexion and extension under a controlled partial load. Rotate your hands to point sideways and repeat for ulnar/radial deviation.</p>
